## 💬 Description

As users should be able to register we need to create a register endpoint.

## 📋 What was done

- Added database connection with spring;
- Added commons lib;
- Adjusted user entity attributes;
- Creating internationalization configuration and archives (en and us);
- Added exception lib;
- Added SpringSecurity configuration;
- Created register endpoint;
- Configurated SpringBoot tests;
- Added unit tests;

